{
  "_comment": "Item lifecycle vectors for engagement.timed-queues. Content from fixtures/catalog.json (definition_version 1, config_version cfg-1). Fixed clock: a case starts at 2026-10-21T12:00:00Z unless a step sets `at`. Account acct-001, tenant tenant-001. Item ids are assigned in creation order per case (item-0001, item-0002, ...). Ledger keys follow README section 6. A step lists only the facts it asserts; every other row and balance stays as before the step.",
  "_usage": "`given` overrides the preset wallet of catalog.json `balances` and the config; `after` names an earlier case whose final state a case continues. `expect.ledger` lists ledger calls in order; a replay lists none. `expect.handoff` lists hand-off events by subject_key, state, fire_at and revision.",

  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "start-craft-bread",
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": "2026-10-21T12:00:00Z",
          "do": { "op": "start", "queue_id": "craft", "job_id": "craft.bread", "attempt_id": "att-001", "slot_index": 0 },
          "expect": {
            "item": { "id": "item-0001", "state": "running", "slot_index": 0, "starts_at": "2026-10-21T12:00:00Z", "ends_at": "2026-10-21T12:15:00Z", "duration_seconds": 900, "schedule_version": 1, "notice_revision": 1, "input_status": "spent", "cancel_refund_fraction": 0.5 },
            "ledger": [{ "op": "spend", "currency": "flour", "amount": 3, "reason": "timed-queues.start", "key": "timed-queues:acct-001:item-0001:start:1" }],
            "balances": { "flour": 6 },
            "handoff": [{ "subject_key": "queue-item:item-0001", "state": "armed", "fire_at": "2026-10-21T12:15:00Z", "revision": 1 }],
            "events": ["queue_item_started"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "chain-and-lane-depth",
      "after": "start-craft-bread",
